exports[`meili teleport > creates a free trial project, adds it to the config file, and exports the data to it 1`] = `
{
  "exitCode": 0,
  "stderr": "Logged in to Meilisearch Cloud as ada@example.com.
local-cloud is a free trial project: free for 14 days.
Meilisearch Cloud is creating local-cloud. It can take several minutes.
While you wait, see the plans and prices at https://www.meilisearch.com/pricing
Project local-cloud is running, and is in the config file as \`local-cloud\`.
Sending the data of local to local-cloud.

