[2KIndexing  [##############################] 100%  3/3 tasks

Your data is in Meilisearch Cloud, in project local-cloud.
Search it:     meili search --project local-cloud --index movies --q "<query>"
Try it:        https://dashboard.test/teams/12/projects/343/preview
Its settings:  https://dashboard.test/teams/12/projects/343/settings/general
",
  "stdout": "",
}
`;

